1
00:00:00,240 --> 00:00:05,040
Centuries ago, a civilization thrived where the deepest blue meets the light.

2
00:00:05,660 --> 00:00:09,600
They built a paradise of gold and marble hidden from the rest of the world.

3
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:11,940
But their power came at a cost.

4
00:00:12,580 --> 00:00:15,460
Overreaching into the heavens, they drew the wrath of the gods.

5
00:00:16,380 --> 00:00:18,700
A great tsunami swallowed the city whole.

6
00:00:19,560 --> 00:00:23,820
Now, only whispers remain urging us to find what sank into the dark.